paragraph.math:
$$\begin{array}{rcl}
  {\int_{a}^{x}{f^{\prime}(t)dt}} & \leqslant & {{\int_{a}^{x}\left\lbrack {f^{\prime}(a) + M\left( {t - a} \right)} \right\rbrack}dt} \\
  {f(x) - f(a)} & \leqslant & {f^{\prime}(a)\left( {x - a} \right) + M\frac{\left( {x - a} \right)^{2}}{2}} \\
  {f(x) - f(a) - f^{\prime}(a)\left( {x - a} \right)} & \leqslant & {\frac{M}{2}\left( {x - a} \right)^{2}}
  \end{array}$$
